{"seq":2,"slug":"three-theorems","title":"三大基本定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/functional-analysis/operators/three-theorems","wordCount":1465,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"三大基本定理\">三大基本定理</h1><p>如果说<a href=\"bounded-operators\">有界线性算子</a>给出了研究对象，那么三大基本定理就是泛函分析的「物理定律」——它们解释了为什么在完备空间上，看似温和的假设能逼出极强的结论。一致有界原理、开映射定理、闭图像定理，三者都把「巴拿赫空间的完备性」兑换成关于算子的硬性结构信息。它们的共同证明引擎是贝尔纲定理，这也是为什么完备性在这里不可或缺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三大定理（有时连同 Hahn-Banach 称四大支柱，后者见<a href=\"../duality-spectrum/dual-hahn-banach\">对偶空间与 Hahn-Banach</a>）各管一类问题：一致有界原理把「逐点有界」升级为「一致有界」；开映射定理保证满射有界算子把开集映成开集，从而连续逆自动有界；闭图像定理把验证「连续」的工作简化为验证「图像闭」。它们的成立前提都是定义域（及多数情形下值域）为巴拿赫空间。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;贝尔纲定理&lt;br/&gt;完备空间非贫集&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;一致有界原理&lt;br/&gt;逐点有界 ⇒ 一致有界&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;开映射定理&lt;br/&gt;满射有界算子是开映射&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;有界逆定理&lt;br/&gt;双射有界算子逆也有界&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E[&quot;闭图像定理&lt;br/&gt;图像闭 ⇒ 算子有界&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; F[&quot;共鸣定理·数值稳定性&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; G[&quot;方程可解性·良态性&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; H[&quot;微分算子·验证连续的捷径&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"贝尔纲定理&lt;br/&gt;完备空间非贫集\"] --&gt; B[\"一致有界原理&lt;br/&gt;逐点有界 ⇒ 一致有界\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"开映射定理&lt;br/&gt;满射有界算子是开映射\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"有界逆定理&lt;br/&gt;双射有界算子逆也有界\"]\n  C --&gt; E[\"闭图像定理&lt;br/&gt;图像闭 ⇒ 算子有界\"]\n  B --&gt; F[\"共鸣定理·数值稳定性\"]\n  D --&gt; G[\"方程可解性·良态性\"]\n  E --&gt; H[\"微分算子·验证连续的捷径\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>定理</th>\n<th>假设</th>\n<th>结论</th>\n<th>直觉</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一致有界原理</td>\n<td>算子族逐点有界</td>\n<td>算子范数一致有界</td>\n<td>局部好 ⇒ 整体好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开映射定理</td>\n<td>满射有界算子</td>\n<td>把开集映成开集</td>\n<td>满射不会「压扁」空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有界逆定理</td>\n<td>双射有界算子</td>\n<td>逆算子也有界</td>\n<td>可逆即良态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>闭图像定理</td>\n<td>图像是闭集</td>\n<td>算子有界</td>\n<td>闭性可替连续性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"一致有界原理-从逐点到一致\">一致有界原理：从逐点到一致</h2><p>一致有界原理（巴拿赫-斯坦豪斯定理）说：若一族有界算子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{T_\\alpha\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 满足对每个固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 都有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>sup</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>α</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sup_\\alpha \\|T_\\alpha x\\| &lt; \\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">sup</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span>（逐点有界），则它们的算子范数一致有界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>sup</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>α</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sup_\\alpha \\|T_\\alpha\\| &lt; \\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">sup</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span>。逐点的弱条件竟逼出一致的强结论，这正是完备性通过贝尔纲定理施加的「魔法」。</p>\n<p>它最著名的应用是傅里叶级数的发散现象：存在连续函数，其傅里叶级数在某点发散——因为部分和算子的范数（勒贝格常数）随阶数无界增长，一致有界原理反过来用，便构造出了反例。在数值分析里它解释了为什么某些逼近格式在所有单个数据上稳定却整体不稳定。该定理也是数列弱收敛蕴含有界性的工具，与<a href=\"../duality-spectrum/weak-convergence-reflexive\">弱收敛与自反性</a>直接相连。</p>\n<h2 id=\"开映射定理与有界逆定理\">开映射定理与有界逆定理</h2><p>开映射定理断言：巴拿赫空间之间的满射有界算子是开映射——它把开集送成开集。一个立即推论极为有用：若有界算子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是双射，则其逆 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 自动有界（有界逆定理）。换言之，只要方程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Tx=y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 唯一可解，解就连续依赖于数据，问题自动良态。</p>\n<p>这把「适定性」（解存在、唯一、连续依赖数据）的三件事压缩成「存在且唯一」两件——连续依赖是赠品。它在偏微分方程与积分方程里价值连城：证明了解的存在唯一后，无需另行论证稳定性。但要注意前提是「双射」，若只单射不满射（如<a href=\"compact-operators\">紧算子</a>常出现的情形），逆可能无界，这正是反问题病态性的根源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"闭图像定理-用闭性替连续性\">闭图像定理：用闭性替连续性</h2><p>直接验证一个算子连续（有界）有时很难，闭图像定理提供了一条捷径。算子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 的图像是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{(x, Tx)\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span></span></span></span></span>，定理说：在巴拿赫空间之间，若图像是闭集，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 有界。而验证图像闭只需检查一个更弱的条件：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>→</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_n \\to x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>→</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Tx_n \\to y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 同时成立时，必有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = Tx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>差别在于：验证连续要从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>→</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_n \\to x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 单方面推出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>→</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Tx_n \\to Tx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>（需要先知道极限存在）；验证图像闭则允许假设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Tx_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 已收敛到某个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>，只需确认 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 恰是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Tx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>。后者往往容易得多。这在算子由「积分关系」「弱形式」隐式定义时尤其好用，是判定隐式定义算子有界性的标准技术。</p>\n<h2 id=\"贝尔纲定理-三定理的共同根基\">贝尔纲定理：三定理的共同根基</h2><p>三大定理表面各异，证明却共享同一引擎——贝尔纲定理：完备度量空间不能写成可数个无处稠密闭集的并，即它「不是贫集」。直觉上，完备空间「足够厚实」，不会被可数个稀疏碎片拼出来，所以总能找到某个碎片在某处「占据了一个开球」，这正好给出三定理所需的「一致控制」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>定理</th>\n<th>如何用到贝尔纲</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一致有界原理</td>\n<td>把空间按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|T_\\alpha x|\\le n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 分层，必有一层含开球</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开映射定理</td>\n<td>像集闭包按尺度分层，必有一层含开球</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>闭图像定理</td>\n<td>由开映射定理转化得到</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这也再次说明：完备性不是可有可无的技术假设，而是这些结论赖以成立的物质基础。脱离巴拿赫空间，三定理一概失效——这与<a href=\"../spaces/metric-completeness\">度量空间与完备性</a>里「完备性是分析地基」的主旨一脉相承。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三大基本定理把巴拿赫空间的完备性兑换成关于算子的硬结论，共同根基是贝尔纲定理。</li>\n<li>一致有界原理把逐点有界升级为一致有界，是傅里叶级数发散反例与弱收敛有界性的工具。</li>\n<li>开映射定理 + 有界逆定理把「适定性」简化为「存在且唯一」，连续依赖数据成为赠品。</li>\n<li>闭图像定理用「图像闭」替「连续」，为隐式定义的算子提供了便捷的有界性判据。</li>\n<li>完备性是上述一切的前提，脱离巴拿赫空间三定理全部失效，与<a href=\"compact-operators\">紧算子</a>的反问题病态性形成对照。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"三大基本定理","id":"三大基本定理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"一致有界原理：从逐点到一致","id":"一致有界原理-从逐点到一致"},{"level":2,"text":"开映射定理与有界逆定理","id":"开映射定理与有界逆定理"},{"level":2,"text":"闭图像定理：用闭性替连续性","id":"闭图像定理-用闭性替连续性"},{"level":2,"text":"贝尔纲定理：三定理的共同根基","id":"贝尔纲定理-三定理的共同根基"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"有界线性算子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/functional-analysis/operators/bounded-operators"},"next":{"title":"紧算子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/functional-analysis/operators/compact-operators"}}